	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p>These massive shields can be used to provide cover to nearly the entire body. Due to their size, they are typically made of wood reinforced with metal. AC increases to +4 if you are using the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ust1jJSCZQUhBZIz]{Take Cover} action.</p><hr><p><strong>Activate—The Wall of Heaven</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (interact)</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once</p><hr><p><strong>Effect</strong> When unsealed, it casts an 8th-level @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.7Iela4GgVeO3LfAo]{Wall of Force}, except that the resultant wall is not invisible, but rather shines with a faint, watercolor pattern of painted mountains and this item permanently dissipates into mist.</p>"
